  "ruleText": "He-M 315.02 Applicability. Nothing in this part shall affect issues between members or participants of a PSA that do not arise out of the operations of the PSA.\n\nSource. #8445, eff 10-6-05, EXPIRED: 10-6-13\n\nNew. #12191, eff 5-26-17",
